WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.401
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.401 --> 00:00:03.803
This is "Late Night." We hope
you're doing well tonight.

00:00:03.803 --> 00:00:05.271
Now, if you don't mind,
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:05.271 --> 00:00:08.641
While speaking yesterday at the
White House's tribal summit,

00:00:08.641 --> 00:00:11.344
President Biden discussed
his high school football career

00:00:11.344 --> 00:00:13.379
and claimed to have been
the runner-up

00:00:13.379 --> 00:00:15.014
in the state
scoring championship.

00:00:15.014 --> 00:00:16.349
Well, I don't know
how to tell you this,

00:00:16.349 --> 00:00:18.151
but runner-up
isn't good enough!

00:00:18.151 --> 00:00:20.386
[ Laughter ]

00:00:20.386 --> 00:00:22.688
The Republican National
Committee held its fourth

00:00:22.688 --> 00:00:25.524
and final presidential debate
last night in Alabama.

00:00:25.524 --> 00:00:27.860
And based on what I saw,
here are my predictions.

00:00:27.860 --> 00:00:28.995
Fox News morning show.

00:00:28.995 --> 00:00:30.629
Couple books nobody will read.

00:00:30.629 --> 00:00:31.964
"Dancing with the Stars."

00:00:31.964 --> 00:00:33.099
Steps in a bucket

00:00:33.099 --> 00:00:34.434
and the bucket
gets stuck on his foot

00:00:34.434 --> 00:00:35.534
and he falls off the porch.

00:00:35.534 --> 00:00:39.205
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:39.205 --> 00:00:40.974
During last night's
Republican debate,

00:00:40.974 --> 00:00:43.810
entrepreneur Vivek Ramaswamy
expressed support

00:00:43.810 --> 00:00:47.246
for several conspiracy theories,
including the far-out idea

00:00:47.246 --> 00:00:49.849
that Vivek Ramaswamy
could become president.

00:00:49.849 --> 00:00:52.084
[ Laughter ]

00:00:52.084 --> 00:00:54.521
House Republicans yesterday
rejected Hunter Biden's

00:00:54.521 --> 00:00:57.289
offer to testify publicly
in front of Congress

00:00:57.289 --> 00:00:59.926
as part of the impeachment
inquiry into President Biden,

00:00:59.926 --> 00:01:01.528
and have threatened
to hold him in contempt

00:01:01.528 --> 00:01:03.696
if he does not appear in
a closed-door session.

00:01:03.696 --> 00:01:06.632
In Hunter Biden's defense,
you get him behind closed doors,

00:01:06.632 --> 00:01:08.268
things tend to get
a little freaky.

00:01:08.268 --> 00:01:10.970
[ Laughter ]

00:01:10.970 --> 00:01:12.772
In a post this week
on Truth Social,

00:01:12.772 --> 00:01:15.308
former president Trump
said he directed Eric Trump

00:01:15.308 --> 00:01:18.777
not to testify again in the
$250 million civil fraud trial

00:01:18.777 --> 00:01:21.180
because, you know,
he just saw him at Thanksgiving.

00:01:21.180 --> 00:01:24.017
[ Laughter ]

00:01:24.017 --> 00:01:26.118
Former Pennsylvania Senator
Rick Santorum

00:01:26.118 --> 00:01:27.853
said in a recent interview
that at least two

00:01:27.853 --> 00:01:30.023
Republican presidential hopefuls
have reached out to him

00:01:30.023 --> 00:01:32.892
for advice.
On what? A concession speech?

00:01:32.892 --> 00:01:35.094
[ Laughter ]

00:01:35.094 --> 00:01:37.263
Lawmakers in Russia
recently set a date

00:01:37.263 --> 00:01:39.599
for the country's
next presidential election --

00:01:39.599 --> 00:01:41.234
Februvember 40th.

00:01:41.234 --> 00:01:44.971
[ Laughter ]

00:01:44.971 --> 00:01:47.273
A deer rose --
A deer recently --

00:01:47.273 --> 00:01:50.009
A deer recently
broke into an elementary school

00:01:50.009 --> 00:01:51.777
in New Jersey --
and this is embarrassing --

00:01:51.777 --> 00:01:53.580
won a spelling bee.

00:01:53.580 --> 00:01:55.014
[ Laughter ]

00:01:55.014 --> 00:01:56.516
This kid's good.

00:01:59.018 --> 00:02:01.153
The roof of a double-decker bus
in England

00:02:01.153 --> 00:02:03.423
was recently ripped off
after it hit a low bridge,

00:02:03.423 --> 00:02:04.858
and passengers were relieved

00:02:04.858 --> 00:02:08.294
because they came this close
to having to finish the tour.

00:02:08.294 --> 00:02:10.563
[ Laughter ]

00:02:10.563 --> 00:02:11.931
And if you look to your left,

00:02:11.931 --> 00:02:15.101
you'll see an old wall
made of stones.

00:02:16.302 --> 00:02:23.009
[ Laughter ]

00:02:26.145 --> 00:02:29.348
I laughed harder when I read
that than they collectively did

00:02:29.348 --> 00:02:30.283
when I said it.

00:02:30.283 --> 00:02:35.521
[ Laughter ]

00:02:35.521 --> 00:02:38.758
Then I do "wall of stones,"
standing ovation.

00:02:38.758 --> 00:02:40.459
[ Laughter ]

00:02:40.459 --> 00:02:42.495
Wait for them to calm down,
move on to the next joke.

00:02:42.495 --> 00:02:43.862
[ Laughter ]

00:02:43.862 --> 00:02:45.231
According to new data,

00:02:45.231 --> 00:02:46.899
fewer Americans
are working from home.

00:02:46.899 --> 00:02:49.202
Turns out they're mostly
just dicking around on the web.

00:02:49.202 --> 00:02:51.371
[ Laughter ]

00:02:51.371 --> 00:02:53.106
By the way, guy who wrote
that joke for me?

00:02:53.106 --> 00:02:53.973
Working from home.

00:02:53.973 --> 00:02:56.943
[ Laughter ]
There he is.

00:02:59.979 --> 00:03:02.982
Authorities in New Jersey
were recently called to capture

00:03:02.982 --> 00:03:05.251
a loose pig named
Albert Einswine...

00:03:05.251 --> 00:03:06.952
[ Laughter ]

00:03:06.952 --> 00:03:08.887
...after it escaped
from its home.

00:03:08.887 --> 00:03:11.824
It was caught safely and
reunited with his brother,

00:03:11.824 --> 00:03:13.026
Sloppenheimer.

00:03:13.026 --> 00:03:15.527
[ Laughter ]

00:03:15.527 --> 00:03:17.163
Same guy wrote that joke.

00:03:17.163 --> 00:03:18.764
[ Laughter ]

00:03:18.764 --> 00:03:20.366
Maybe less dicking around
on the web, Brian.

00:03:20.366 --> 00:03:21.767
[ Laughter ]

00:03:21.767 --> 00:03:23.436
Maybe you come back to work.
Look me in the [bleep] eyes

00:03:23.436 --> 00:03:24.437
when you write these jokes.

00:03:24.437 --> 00:03:26.238
[ Laughter ]

00:03:26.238 --> 00:03:29.042
Maybe not click send.

00:03:32.979 --> 00:03:35.314
And finally, a cargo ship
yesterday broke down

00:03:35.314 --> 00:03:37.750
in Egypt's Suez Canal
and crashed into a bridge.

00:03:37.750 --> 00:03:38.918
And you're not
going to believe this.

00:03:38.918 --> 00:03:40.753
Everything you just bought
for your family

00:03:40.753 --> 00:03:43.189
for the holidays was on it.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:43.189 --> 00:03:45.157
And that was a monologue,
everybody.

00:03:45.157 --> 00:03:46.426
We've got a great show
for you tonight.

